        "Stem": "Lakeland Industries recently completed its annual external audit. During the audit closing meeting, the CFO stated, 'The external auditors confirmed our internal controls are effective, so responsibility for maintaining those controls now shifts to them for the coming year.' Which of the following statements is correct regarding the CFO's assertion?",
