        "Stem": "Meridian Healthcare's procurement policy states: (1) department heads may approve purchases up to $5,000 within their approved budget, (2) purchases between $5,001 and $50,000 require the purchasing director's approval, (3) purchases over $50,000 require approval from the CFO and a vice president. This multi-tiered approval structure is an example of:",
