        "Stem": "During the preparation of its quarterly Form 10-Q filing, the CEO and CFO of Delta Manufacturing must certify several items. One certification required by Section 302 of the Sarbanes-Oxley Act that is NOT explicitly required by the separate Section 906 criminal certification is:",
